{"type":"text","timestamp":1792510458181,"sessionID":"ses_ea6165c0bffec0GbYC1A6HUELg","part":{"id":"prt_159f2f57c001QxoZ13p2Hmxu6i","messageID":"msg_159f2d8ed001v320k6mTUIpLsD","sessionID":"ses_ea6165c0bffec0GbYC1A6HUELg","type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm verifying that the `dist[z] + 1 == dist[x]` check in phase 1 automatically excludes unreachable vertices since x is never the root, and confirming that the `z not in lost` guard handles the case where z is a cousin in the subtree. Now I'll validate and benchmark this logic.\n\n","time":{"start":1792510457212,"end":1792510458172}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792510474188,"sessionID":"ses_ea6165c0bffec0GbYC1A6HUELg","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-9870557a9d34a183","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"python3 /proj/MPS/MPS_DEV_REPO/ethomdt/evoalgo-scratch/dynbfs/validate.py && python3 /proj/MPS/MPS_DEV_REPO/ethomdt/evoalgo-scratch/dynbfs/bench.py","timeout":600000},"output":"FAILURES: 0\nSTRESS FAILURES: 0\ninit:   cand=28.855ms off=21.615ms ratio=1.335\nupdate: cand=32.073ms off=119.753ms ratio=0.268\ntotal ratio: 0.431\nno-op updates: 23879, non-no-op: 16121\nper-update cand ns: 802, per-update off ns: 2994\n","metadata":{"output":"FAILURES: 0\nSTRESS FAILURES: 0\ninit:   cand=28.855ms off=21.615ms ratio=1.335\nupdate: cand=32.073ms off=119.753ms ratio=0.268\ntotal ratio: 0.431\nno-op updates: 23879, non-no-op: 16121\nper-update cand ns: 802, per-update off ns: 2994\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"python3 /proj/MPS/MPS_DEV_REPO/ethomdt/evoalgo-scratch/dynbfs/validate.py && python3 /proj/MPS/MPS_DEV_REPO/ethomdt/evoalgo-scratch/dynbfs/bench.py","time":{"start":1792510474147,"end":1792510474181}},"id":"prt_159f2f702001Bdeuftk7DNOvvs","sessionID":"ses_ea6165c0bffec0GbYC1A6HUELg","messageID":"msg_159f2d8ed001v320k6mTUIpLsD"}}
